FROM gemma3:12b
# gemma3 has no "thinking" mechanism at all (unlike qwen3/gemma4) — the reason
# it replaced qwen3:14b here, see llm/README.md's "Model selection, final state".
# 32768, not Gemma 3's full 131072 (2026-11-07). Ollama reserves memory for the whole
# window on every load: 9.0 GB at 128K, 8.1 GB at 32K, 7.1 GB at 16K (measured on this
# 24 GB Mac). Of 38,607 requests in the Ollama log the largest was 17,560 tokens and none
# passed 32K, so 32K loses nothing. Speed is the same at any size. A prompt longer than
# num_ctx is cut from the start without warning, which is why this is not 16K.
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
